{
  "id": 8834765455559,
  "title": "Custom Football Helmet on American Flag Vintage Comforter",
  "handle": "custom-football-helmet-on-american-flag-vintage-comforter-43f12dbb8d-43f12dbb8d",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your space with this sports-themed football bedding set from Jeminise. Perfect for football players, fans, and coaches, this comforter set adds a cool, athletic touch to any bedroom or boys' room decor. It is designed to offer a super soft feel and a layer of breathable warmth, making it a thoughtful gift for birthdays, holidays, or special celebrations.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features custom options with text inputs to personalize with a name or number.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Type Options:</strong> Available as either a lightweight duvet cover (designed to be paired with an insert) or a cozy, thicker comforter with a soft microfiber filling.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Twin (68x88 or 68x90 inches), Full (78x88 or 79x90 inches), Queen (88x88 or 90x90 inches), and King (104x88 or 104x90 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Includes 1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) with optional matching pillowcases and flat sheet covers.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, tumble dry on low heat, and quick-drying.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Vintage Football Helmet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Football Helmet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
